    puts stderr {Transmission Tomography and Radiation Therapy GATE is an advanced}
    puts stderr {opensource software developed by the international OpenGATE}
    puts stderr {collaboration and dedicated to numerical simulations in medical imaging}
    puts stderr {and radiotherapy. It currently supports simulations of Emission}
    puts stderr {Tomography (Positron Emission Tomography - PET and Single Photon}
    puts stderr {Emission Computed Tomography - SPECT), Computed Tomography (CT), Optical}
    puts stderr {Imaging (Bioluminescence and Fluorescence) and Radiotherapy experiments.}
    puts stderr {Using an easy-to-learn macro mechanism to configurate simple or highly}
    puts stderr {sophisticated experimental settings, GATE now plays a key role in the}
    puts stderr {design of new medical imaging devices, in the optimization of}
    puts stderr {acquisition protocols and in the development and assessment of image}
    puts stderr {reconstruction algorithms and correction techniques. It can also be used}
    puts stderr {for dose calculation in radiotherapy experiments.}
}

